0 HEAD
1 SOUR gedcom-go
2 VERS 1.0.0
2 NAME gedcom-go test suite
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 NOTE Malformed coordinate test file.
2 CONT Original work for issue #504. @I1@ carries a PLAC MAP whose LATI is a
2 CONT non-finite literal and whose LONG is a hexadecimal float literal;
2 CONT neither is a GEDCOM coordinate, so each must produce an INVALID_VALUE
2 CONT diagnostic while the raw text survives into the typed model.
2 CONT @I2@ carries a well-formed MAP that must stay quiet.
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Malformed /Coordinates/
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Nowhere
3 MAP
4 LATI Nnan
4 LONG E0x1p3
0 @I2@ INDI
1 NAME Valid /Coordinates/
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Boston, Massachusetts, USA
3 MAP
4 LATI N42.3601
4 LONG W71.0589
0 TRLR
